OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does a raised threat level
OL,4,Amean for US airbases in Suffolk?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people are under investigation
OL,7,Ffollowing reports of suspicious
OL,8,Fvehicles outside RAF Fairford,
OL,9,Fprompting a higher security level at US
OL,10,Fairbases across the country - including
OL,11,Fin Suffolk. What does this mean for
OL,12,FLakenheath and Mildenhall?
OL,14,FA major incident was declared and
OL,15,Fdozens of homes were evacuated after
OL,16,Fpolice were alerted to three vehicles
OL,17,Fnear the Gloucestershire base - used by
OL,18,Fthe US - in the early hours of Sunday.
OL,20,FFive men from London were held by
OL,21,Fpolice on suspicion of explosive and
OL,22,Fterrorism offences and later bailed.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
