OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does a raised threat level
OL,4,Amean for US airbases in Suffolk?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounter-terror police said the men
OL,7,Fremained under investigation and their
OL,8,Frelease was "subject to stringent
OL,9,Fconditions on their movement and
OL,10,Fcontact with others".
